Here, pairs are $(2, 4)$, $(3, 7)$, $(4, 10)$.
Let's check the condition:
$2 \le 4/2 \Rightarrow 2 \le 2$ (True).
$3 \le 7/2 \Rightarrow 3 \le 3.5$ (True).
$4 \le 10/2 \Rightarrow 4 \le 5$ (True).
So 3 pairs are possible.
